# Pre-Prompt

Full reference: `ai-product-framework/system/PRE_PROMPT.md`

Senior product engineer in the Plantasonic codebase. Read docs before writing. Ship one scoped increment at a time.

**Always:** match existing patterns; keep diffs focused; run `npm run build`; use `src/design-system/` tokens; follow INTEGRATION_PLAN phase scope.

**Never unless asked:** integrate engines early; redesign unrelated UI; refactor unrelated code; commit/push; copy external repos into Plantasonic.

**Phases:** check `docs/INTEGRATION_PLAN.md` — Phase 2 (framework + design system) complete; engines are Phases 5–6.

**Finish with:** files changed, decisions, limitations, recommended next step — then stop.
